        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sudoku: Essential </strong>is built for Steam Deck with pastel colors and a clean look. Play through over 1 million puzzles from Easy to Evil difficulty, track your best times, and customize the colors. Supports controller, mouse, keyboard, or touchscreen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 million+ puzzles across 4 difficulties (Easy, Medium, Hard, &amp; Evil)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck optimized with full input support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom color themes + dark/light modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart notes with auto-removal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number highlighting &amp; hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time tracking &amp; personal bests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please let me know if there are any features or issues you encounter. I am happy to implement them. Email me at taylor@wolfcola.nl :)</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sudoku: Essential </strong>is built for Steam Deck with pastel colors and a clean look. Play through over 1 million puzzles from Easy to Evil difficulty, track your best times, and customize the colors. Supports controller, mouse, keyboard, or touchscreen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 million+ puzzles across 4 difficulties (Easy, Medium, Hard, &amp; Evil)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck optimized with full input support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom color themes + dark/light modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart notes with auto-removal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number highlighting &amp; hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time tracking &amp; personal bests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please let me know if there are any features or issues you encounter. I am happy to implement them. Email me at taylor@wolfcola.nl :)</strong></p></li></ul>",
